--- | --- |\n| 2 BHK | - | ₹ 1.3 L |\n| 3 BHK | - | ₹ 3.4 L |\n\n### Recent Updates\n\nGet the latest price and market updates for Bhurji Dharam Castle.\n\nA total of 1 residential transactions has been registered so far for Bhurji Dharam Castle, amounting to ₹ 80 L till September 2026.\n\nDuring Q2'2026, average property prices for Bhurji Dharam Castle moved from ₹ 59,200/sqft to ₹ 64,200/sqft, reflecting a 8.45% rise.\n\nDuring Q1'2026, average property prices for Bhurji Dharam Castle moved from ₹ 53,800/sqft to ₹ 59,200/sqft, reflecting a 10.04% rise.\n\nDuring Q4'2025, average property prices for Bhurji Dharam Castle moved from ₹ 53,450/sqft to ₹ 53,800/sqft, reflecting a 0.65% rise.\n\nA total of 1 out of 14 launched units have been booked as of November 2025, including 9% of 3 BHK(1 out of 11 units).\n\nA total of 1 out of 14 launched units have been booked as of July 2024, including 9% of 3 BHK(1 out of 11 units).\n\nStructural Works reach 80% completion, External Works has reached 99%, Internal finishing stands at 97%, MEP Services including lift and staircases, are now 98% done.\n\nA total of 10 out of 14 launched units have been booked as of June 2022, including 64% of 3 BHK(7 out of 11 units), 100% of 1 BHK(1 units), 2 BHK(2 units).\n\nDHARAM CASTLE, developed by BHURJI DEVELOPERS LLP, officially launched on 05-Jun-2018 and expected to complete by 31-Mar-2027. Registered under RERA No. P51900016656. The project comprises 1 towers and offers 14 residential units, including 1 BHK, 2 BHK, 3 BHK, with unit sizes ranging from 323 to 775 Square feet across a total area of 0.07 Acre.\n\n### Govt. Registrations\n\n1 Sales Transactions Registered in Bhurji Dharam Castle From Oct 25 to Sep 26 at Avg. Price ₹ 23.4 K/Sq.Ft.\n\n| Sales Transactions | Gross Sales Value | Registered Rate |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 1 | ₹ 80 L | ₹ 23,400 / Sq. Ft. |\n\nTransaction Period Oct 25 to Sep 26\n\n## Bhurji Dharam Castle Floor Plans\n\n### 1 BHK 334 Sq. Ft. Apartment\n\n(Carpet A